{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104221","id":2395987107,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Oz9yj","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104221","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104221.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104221.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104221","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104221/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104221/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104221/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a6dc34541500fe5509a9b590fb5e5a895bac99ba","number":104221,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix tangent baking for curves when cubic derivatives are 0","user":{"login":"Teschnique","id":519151,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTE1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/519151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teschnique","html_url":"https://github.com/Teschnique","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teschnique/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teschnique/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teschnique/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teschnique/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teschnique/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teschnique/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teschnique/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teschnique/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teschnique/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This attempts to fix the [issue](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100590) where the path-follower does not smoothly follow the curve due to the tangent being computed incorrectly when there are collinear control points.\r\n\r\nThe problem can be most easily understood with the scenario where one of the control points is collinear with the anchor points and the other is not.  In this case the control points form a quadratic bezier curve but is treated as a linear curve.\r\n\r\nFor example given `begin`, `c1`, `c2`, `end` if `begin` and `c1` are the same but `c2` and `end` are distinct from the other points the current code will return `end` - `begin` when it should return `c2` - `begin` (when `t` is 0).\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100590*\r\n* Fixes #82658","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7008779076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABocF7RA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.3","name":"cherrypick:4.3","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.3.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.co